<title>USA: HFS to end license pact with AMRE.</title>
<headline>HFS to end license pact with AMRE.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc said Friday it plans to terminate its license agreement with AMRE Inc, under which AMRE operates under the Century 21 Home Improvements name.</p>
<p>AMRE announced today that had ceased operations and would seek protection under Chapter 11 of the U.S. Bankruptcy Code.</p>
<p>HFS said it was fully reserved for its investments in and receivables from AMRE in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>It said it expects to license the Century 21 Home Improvements name to other parties.</p>
</text>
